Description: Custom freedesktop notifications daemon for Wayland/Sway
 A lightweight Python daemon implementing org.freedesktop.Notifications.
 It is tuned for Sway/Wayland and uses gtk-layer-shell when available
 to render toast-style notifications that do not reserve workspace layout.
